    "description": "I-595 Express, LLC is the concessionaire for the approximately 10.5-mile I-595 managed-lane corridor in Broward County, Florida. The company financed, designed and built the improvements and operates and maintains the corridor under a 35-year availability-payment DBFOM agreement with the Florida Department of Transportation. TIAA/Nuveen owns 87.5% through I 595 Toll Road, LLC and the TIAA General Account, while ACS/Iridium retains 12.5%. No later equity transfer or signed pending sale was identified through September 1, 2026. FDOT, the roadway and managed lanes, contractors, operators, lenders, noteholders and financing SPVs are counterparties or components rather than separate PortCos.",
